@startuml tac_runtime
title MiniPar - TAC e runtime C++

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
left to right direction
hide empty members

package "Codigo intermediario em Python" {
  class TACGenerator {
    +lines : list[str]
    +generate_text(program : Program) : str
    +generate(program : Program, output_name : str) : str
  }
  class TACExecutor {
    +TACExecutor(max_steps : int = 100000)
    +execute(tac : str, inputs : Iterable[str] = ()) : tuple[dict[str, Any], list[str]]
  }
  class "Texto TAC\n(.tac)" as TACText <<artefato>>
}

TACGenerator ..> Program : traduz AST
TACGenerator ..> TACText : grava
TACExecutor ..> TACText : interpreta texto

package "Geracao e compilacao C++" {
  class CppCodeGenerator {
    +generate(program : Program, output_name : str) : bool
  }
  class DriverGCC {
    +compile(source_path : str | Path) : bool
  }
  class "Codigo C++" as CppSource <<artefato>>
  class "Executavel" as Executable <<artefato>>
}

CppCodeGenerator ..> Program : traduz AST
CppCodeGenerator ..> CppSource : grava
CppCodeGenerator *--> DriverGCC : instancia
DriverGCC ..> Executable : compila

package "Runtime compilado junto ao executavel (runtime/)" {
  class MiniParChannel {
    +ip : std::string
    +port : int
    +MiniParChannel(address : std::string, channel_port : int)
    +sendData(message : std::string) : void
    +receiveData() : std::string
  }
  class "minipar_parallel" as MiniparParallel <<funcao livre>> {
    +minipar_parallel(tasks : const std::vector<std::function<void()>>&) : void
  }
  class "minipar_rt.hpp" as RuntimeHeader <<artefato>>
  class "canal.cpp" as ChannelSource <<artefato>>
  class "paralelo.cpp" as ParallelSource <<artefato>>
}

note right of RuntimeHeader
  Tambem declara helpers de entrada,
  conversao, listas, matrizes e range.
end note

DriverGCC ..> RuntimeHeader : inclui
DriverGCC ..> ChannelSource : compila e linka
DriverGCC ..> ParallelSource : compila e linka
RuntimeHeader ..> MiniParChannel : declara
RuntimeHeader ..> MiniparParallel : declara
ChannelSource ..> MiniParChannel : define metodos
ParallelSource ..> MiniparParallel : define
Executable ..> MiniParChannel : usa
Executable ..> MiniparParallel : usa

note bottom of TACText
  O TAC atual e texto; as classes InstrucaoTAC
  e suas subclasses estao documentadas em
  tac_planejado.puml, como modelo futuro.
end note
@enduml
